I added a loop in `statementLines` that prints one `  Payment  <day>  <amount>  <method>` line per payment, directly above the "Paid" line. It uses `isoDay` and `formatPence`, like the other lines. An invoice with no payments prints none.

I loop over `this.payments` directly and assumed `pay()` appends to it without sorting, so the lines come out in the order recorded. I couldn't see `pay()`, so please check that it doesn't reorder the array.
